// array_remove_ordered of a resizable array whose count says it has
// elements but whose data is null, with bounds checks off (issue #158,
// spec 3.17, 8.4; resizable_array_null_data_unchecked.flags): its data is
// checked as a view's is, bounds checks on or off, and the program stops
// at the built-in's name.
main :: () {
    a : [..]int;
    a.count = 2;
    array_remove_ordered(*a, 0);
}
